BT /F1 12 Tf 72 740 Td 14 TL (Dashboard Warning Color and Drive-or-Stop Guide\\n\\nRed coolant, oil pressure, brake \(not parking brake\), battery/charging, and EPS warnings mean stop safely now. A flashing check-engine light is urgent even though the lamp is amber. A steady check-engine or TPMS light is drive-cautiously-to-dealer, not a red-light stop. A maintenance wrench is an interval reminder, not an oil-pressure emergency. Always read the multi-information display text.) Tj ET
